{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011CgEMgwXEUoSBeTR1QZ8Lz","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I've read the code, logs, and tickets. The causes are clear enough to fix:\n\n- **Connect fails for everyone:** init is a GET reached by an `<a href>`, so the browser navigation has no `Authorization` header and gets 401.\n- **Authorize step rejects duplicate scopes:** `SCOPES` lists `ACTIVITY:READ,ACTIVITY:WRITE` and `CALENDAR:READ,CALENDAR:WRITE`.\n- **\"Reconnect after an hour\":** the token response has no `expires_in`, so `DEFAULT_TOKEN_TTL=3600` applies. The refresher then marks the connection expired, even though Intervals tokens don't expire.\n- **Token exchange and state:** the exchange sends `grant_type` and `redirect_uri`. The state has no `purpose` claim and isn't a JWT. The reconnect account-mismatch guard is missing.\n\nI'll start with the config."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":8690,"cache_read_input_tokens":23713,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":8690},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"41dddc1f-8fb6-4204-aee7-77c938fb5338","uuid":"7524cc03-d2f7-40e6-b835-ced82acedd18","timestamp":"2026-10-20T23:29:55.411Z","request_id":"req_011CgEMgwG7PaN5mrz46mP8A"}
